## 10. Example with Two Elements

For:

```text
[1, 2]
```

Start:

```text
[]
```

Choose `1`:

```text
[1]
```

Choose `2`:

```text
[1, 2]
```

Undo `2`:

```text
[1]
```

Undo `1`:

```text
[]
```

Choose `2`:

```text
[2]
```

Choose `1`:

```text
[2, 1]
```

Final result:

```text
[1, 2]
[2, 1]
```

